{{also|hésitant}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} stem of {{term|haesitans}}, present participle of {{term|haesito|haesitare|lang=la|to stick fast, to hesitate}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Tending to [[hesitate]], [[wait]], or proceed with [[caution]] or [[reservation]].
#: ''I am '''hesitant''' to recommend him as a manager because he has a short temper.''

